  "content": "[Intro]\n[A#m]\n[G#]  [G#7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C#]Chestnuts [D#m7]roasting on an\n[Fm]open fire [F#]\n[C#]Jack Frost [D#m7]nipping [D#m7b5]at your\n[C#]nose\n[C#]Yuletide [Cdim7]carols\n[C#]being sung by [G#]choir [G]\n[F]And Folks [Ebm/C]dressed up [Cdim7]like Es-\n[Fm]kimos [Ebm/C][G#7]Everybo-\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C#]dy knows [D#m7]a turkey and\n[Fm]some mistletoe [F#]\n[C#]Help to [D#m7]make [D#m7b5]the season\n[C#]bright\n[C#]Tiny [Cdim7]tots with their\n[C#]eyes all [G#]aglow [G]Will\n[F]find it hard [Ebm/C]to sleep [Cdim7]to-\n[Fm]night [Ebm/C][G#7]They know\n\n[Verse 3]\n[C#]that [D#m7]Santa's on\n[Fm]his way [F#]He's\n[C#]loaded lots of toys [D#m7]and [D#m7b5]goodies on\n[C#]his sleigh And\n[C#]every mother's child [Cdim7]\n[C#]is gonna spy [G#][G]To see if\n[F]reindeer [Ebm/C]really know [Cdim7]\n[Fm]how to fly [Ebm/C][G#7]And\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#]so we're [D#m7]offering\n[Fm]this simple phrase [F#]\n[C#]To kids [D#m7]from one [D#m7b5]to\n[C#]ninetytwo\n[C#]Although it's [Cdim7]been said\n[C#]many times Many [G#]ways, [G]Merry\n[Gmaj7][G#maj7]Christmas [F#maj7][Fmaj7]to\n[C#]you\n\n[Solo Piano]\n[B]  [Bdim7]\n[C#]\n[B]  [Bdim7]\n[C#]\n\n[Solo Guitar]\n[C#m7b5]  [B]\n[E]\n[D#7]\n[G#7]And\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#]so we're [D#m7]offering\n[Fm]this simple phrase [F#]\n[C#]To kids [D#m7]from one [D#m7b5]\n[C#]to ninetytwo\n[C#]Although it's [Cdim7]been said\n[C#]many times Many [Em7b5]ways, [D#m7b5]Merry\n\n[Outro]\n[Gmaj7][G#maj7]Christmas [F#maj7]\n[G#7]to\n[C#]you",
